{"jsonrpc": "2.0", "id": 2, "result": {"content": [{"type": "text", "text": "  ucas: it(f) = f\n  ucas: integrate it\n∫ f df\n  = f^2/2 + C\n  check: d/df of it equals the integrand at 401 points of [-10, 10] (max difference 0)\n"}], "structuredContent": {"id": 2, "ok": true, "cmd": "english", "ucas": "integral of f", "structured": true, "result": {"kind": "english", "statements": ["it(f) = f", "integrate it"], "understood": true, "results": [{"kind": "integrate", "var": "f", "integrand": "f", "antiderivative": "f^2/2"}]}, "notes": [], "conditions": [], "checks": [{"kind": "derivative", "points": 401, "max_diff": 0, "passed": true, "text": "d/dx of the antiderivative against the integrand"}], "files": [], "text": "  ucas: it(f) = f\n  ucas: integrate it\n∫ f df\n  = f^2/2 + C\n  check: d/df of it equals the integrand at 401 points of [-10, 10] (max difference 0)\n"}, "isError": false}}
